  {
    "id": "400954",
    "original": "主人は晩酌が楽しみなので、発泡酒を６缶以上は空けていますし、日本酒の燗が５本も６本も空いていて、たまに休肝日ということで飲まない日もあるのですが２日以上続いたことはありません。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "400955",
        "text": "My husband likes to have a drink in the evening. He drinks 6 or more bottles of sparkling wine and 5 or 6 bottles of warm sake. Sometimes he has a day where he doesn't drink, but it has never lasted for more than two days."
